# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Xcode's own build cache when building/running directly from Xcode
# rather than `flutter build`/`flutter run` (PIFCache etc.) - not source,
# machine-specific, and large; accidentally committed once already.
ios/build/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Gradle/Kotlin incremental compilation cache - not source, machine-specific.
android/.kotlin/
